    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terminal Bore is a 2D mining game inspired by classics like Motherload. Dig deep, craft upgrades, and overcome obstacles as you become an unstoppable mining machine.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new ores as you progress. Ores are initially un-mineable, so you will have to upgrade your drill to dig deeper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research ores to discover their uses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft new components to upgrade your miner</p></li></ul>",
